  {
    "speaker": "番組スタッフ",
    "text": "──有栖川さんに出演していただくのは\r\nコーディネート対決のコーナーです",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "番組スタッフ",
    "text": "ショッピングモール内でお題にあった\r\n全身コーディネートをしていただいて",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "番組スタッフ",
    "text": "番組が用意した素人さんに着用してもらいます\r\n……っていうのはご存知ですよね？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013010010060,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "はい、もちろんです",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201301001/2013010010060"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "se": "0181",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "番組スタッフ",
    "text": "あー……有栖川さんの特技は\r\n『トータルコーディネート』なんですね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013010010070,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "はい、ですから……",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201301001/2013010010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013010010080,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "このコーナーに出演させていただくのが\r\nとても楽しみでした",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301001/2013010010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "番組スタッフ",
    "text": "じゃあ紹介にそれ、\r\n入れさせてもらいますねー",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "番組スタッフ",
    "text": "ちなみに他の番組さんとかで\r\nこういうコーナーに出たことってあります？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013010010090,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "いえ、今回が初めてで──",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301001/2013010010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "番組スタッフ",
    "text": "あー、ですよね\r\nなんかあんまりそういうイメージ無いから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013010010100,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "え？",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301001/2013010010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "番組スタッフ",
    "text": "ウェディングドレス着た広告のやつとか\r\n印象的でしたけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "番組スタッフ",
    "text": "あとほら、アプリのキャラの格好とか\r\nされてたじゃないですか",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "番組スタッフ",
    "text": "なんかそういう印象なんですよねー……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013010010110,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……ふふ、そうですか",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301001/2013010010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "番組スタッフ",
    "text": "あはは、すみません\r\nこちらの勉強不足だとは思うんですけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013010010120,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "いいえ、構いません",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301001/2013010010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013010010130,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "そんなイメージを覆す機会をくださって\r\nありがとうございます",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301001/2013010010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "番組スタッフ",
    "text": "…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013010010140,
